cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, cite the preprint below. The software itself is
  cited by this file; the measurements it reports are cited by the preprint,
  and the result files behind them by the data archive.
title: sal-torch
abstract: >-
  A measured compression tool for PyTorch transformers: diagnose structural
  fragility, route by a measured probe, prune, recover, and verify against a
  dense control trained for the same budget.
type: software
authors:
